  "statement": "I appreciate the deliberations regarding the alignment of requirements. I maintain that EFF-01 and EFF-02 are critical for performance efficiency and should remain unchanged to ensure rapid transaction processing and throughput. I support the synthesis proposed for SAF-04, EFF-03, and GRN-04 for efficient transaction logging. Additionally, I propose to modify EFF-05 to clarify that it should align with SAF-02 and RES-05 regarding automatic fund withdrawals, ensuring responsiveness while maintaining operational integrity. I will also consider modifying EFF-04 to reflect the synthesis with SAF-04 for better clarity on preventing negative balances. I concede to the potential adjustment of EFF-03 for efficiency and clarity in logging.",
